---
import { Button, Spoiler, Timeline } from 'astro-pure/user'
import PageLayout from '@/layouts/CommonPage.astro'
import ToolSection from '@/components/about/ToolSection.astro'

const headings = [
  { depth: 2, slug: 'hobbies', text: 'Hobbies' },
  { depth: 2, slug: 'tools', text: 'Tools' },
  { depth: 2, slug: 'social-networks', text: 'Social Networks' },
  { depth: 2, slug: 'about-blog', text: 'About Blog' }
]
---

<PageLayout title='About' {headings} comment>
  {/* TODO: 在这里写你的自我介绍 */}
  <p>这里写一句话介绍你自己。</p>
  <p>
    Motto: Stay hungry, Stay foolish. <Spoiler>这里可以藏一句悄悄话。</Spoiler>
  </p>

  {/* hobbies */}
  <h2 id='hobbies'>Hobbies</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>爱好一</li>
    <li>爱好二</li>
  </ul>

  {/* tools */}
  <h2 id='tools'>Tools</h2>
  <p>Current support tools as follow:</p>
  <ToolSection
    class='mb-5'
    title='Productivity'
    tools={[
      {
        name: 'Chrome',
        description: 'Browser',
        href: 'https://www.google.com/chrome/',
        icon: import('@/assets/tools/chrome.svg?raw')
      },
      {
        name: 'Firefox',
        description: 'Browser',
        href: 'https://www.mozilla.org/en-US/firefox',
        icon: import('@/assets/tools/firefox.svg?raw')
      },
      {
        name: 'Obsidian',
        description: 'Note Taking',
        href: 'https://www.obsidian.md/',
        icon: import('@/assets/tools/notion.svg?raw')
      },
      {
        name: 'Typora',
        description: 'Markdown Editor',
        href: 'https://typora.io/',
        icon: import('@/assets/tools/typora.svg?raw')
      }
    ]}
  />
  <ToolSection
    class='mb-5'
    title='Development'
    tools={[
      {
        name: 'VS Code',
        description: 'IDE',
        href: 'https://code.visualstudio.com/',
        icon: import('@/assets/tools/vscode.svg?raw')
      },
      {
        name: 'Neovim',
        description: 'IDE',
        href: 'https://neovim.io/',
        icon: import('@/assets/tools/neovim.svg?raw')
      }
    ]}
  />
  <ToolSection
    class='mb-5'
    title='Environment'
    tools={[
      {
        name: 'Arch Linux',
        description: 'Linux Distribution',
        href: 'https://archlinux.org/',
        icon: import('@/assets/tools/archlinux.svg?raw')
      },
      {
        name: 'Ubuntu 20.04 LTS',
        description: 'Windows Subsystem for Linux',
        href: 'https://ubuntu.com/',
        icon: import('@/assets/tools/ubuntu.svg?raw')
      },
      {
        name: 'Windows 11',
        description: 'Lenovo XiaoXinPro 14',
        href: 'https://news.microsoft.com/windows11-general-availability/',
        icon: import('@/assets/tools/windows11.svg?raw')
      }
    ]}
  />

  {/* social-networks */}
  <h2 id='social-networks'>Social Networks</h2>
  <p>我的社交媒体与联系方式都整理在 Connect 页面，欢迎来打个招呼。</p>
  <Button title='查看全部联系方式' class='w-fit' href='/connect' variant='ahead' />

  {/* about-blog */}
  <h2 id='about-blog'>About Blog</h2>
  <p>建站历程：</p>
  <Timeline
    events={[
      {
        date: '2026-03-04',
        content:
          '使用 <a href="https://astro.build/" target="_blank">Astro</a> + <a href="https://github.com/cworld1/astro-theme-pure" target="_blank">Astro Theme Pure</a> 搭建博客'
      }
    ]}
  />
  <p>本站的搭建与运行依赖以下优秀的项目 / 服务：</p>
  <ul>
    <li>框架与主题：<a href='https://astro.build/' target='_blank'>Astro</a> + <a href='https://github.com/cworld1/astro-theme-pure' target='_blank'>Astro Theme Pure</a></li>
    <li>部署：<a href='https://pages.cloudflare.com/' target='_blank'>Cloudflare Pages</a></li>
    <li>评论系统：<a href='https://waline.js.org' target='_blank'>Waline</a></li>
  </ul>
</PageLayout>
